{"name":"Accessibility by UserWay","slug":"userway-accessibility-widget","version":"2.6.6","author":"<a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/userwayorg\/\">UserWay<\/a>","author_profile":"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/userwayorg\/","contributors":{"userwayorg":{"profile":"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/userwayorg\/","avatar":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/76f92c991e33f76e3874c23a56fca36326f09196b3c4513173599aaea349b994?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g","display_name":"UserWay"}},"requires":"4.7","tested":"6.9.11","requires_php":false,"requires_plugins":[],"rating":80,"ratings":{"5":40,"4":1,"3":3,"2":0,"1":13},"num_ratings":57,"support_url":"https:\/\/wordpress.org\/support\/plugin\/userway-accessibility-widget\/","support_threads":0,"support_threads_resolved":0,"active_installs":80000,"last_updated":"2025-12-08 10:38am GMT","added":"2017-01-20","homepage":"https:\/\/userway.org","sections":{"description":"<p>Web accessibility can seem complex and overwhelming if you don\u2019t know where to start.<\/p>\n<p>Let us make it easier, and, to coin a phrase, more accessible for everyone. UserWay\u2019s Accessibility Widget creates a simpler and more accessible browsing experience for your users while increasing compliance with WCAG 2.1, ATAG 2.0, European EN 301 549, ADA, &amp; Section 508 requirements.<\/p>\n<p>UserWay\u2019s Accessibility Widget will strengthen any weak areas that could cause accessibility issues on your site. We are proud to say that a significant number of websites are more accessible today thanks to UserWay.<\/p>\n<p>UserWay\u2019s Accessibility Widget makes smart modifications to elements on your site that are identified as being non-compliant, that may prevent keyboard-only navigation, or are in violation of ADA regulations.<\/p>\n<p>Install UserWay\u2019s Accessibility Widget today.<br \/>\nAfter installing UserWay\u2019s Accessibility Widget, you will receive login instructions to the widget via email.<\/p>\n<p><strong>ADA &amp; WCAG 2.1 Compliance<\/strong><br \/>\nUserWay\u2019s best-in-class accessibility solutions move your site towards ADA and WCAG 2.1 compliance.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Shield Against Lawsuits<\/strong><br \/>\nIncreasing your accessibility provides real, sustainable improvement for all users, and protects you from accessibility-related lawsuits.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Improve SEO, Boost Traffic<\/strong><br \/>\nMake your commitment clear: a more inclusive site for everyone expands your demographic and boosts your SEO.<\/p>\n","installation":"<ol>\n<li>Install the plugin into your WordPress project<\/li>\n<li>Go to website control panel<\/li>\n<li>Go to the &#8220;plugins&#8221; webpage<\/li>\n<li>Activate the plugin &#8220;UserWay Accessibility Widget&#8221;<\/li>\n<li>Sign-up plug-in on Settings-&gt; UserWay page<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>For more details please visit <a href=\"https:\/\/userway.org\/wp\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https:\/\/userway.org\/wp<\/a><\/p>\n","screenshots":"<ol><li><a href=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/userway-accessibility-widget\/assets\/screenshot-1.jpg?rev=2796965\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/userway-accessibility-widget\/assets\/screenshot-1.jpg?rev=2796965\" alt=\"Plugin Check\"><\/a><p>Plugin Check<\/p><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/userway-accessibility-widget\/assets\/screenshot-2.jpg?rev=2796965\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/userway-accessibility-widget\/assets\/screenshot-2.jpg?rev=2796965\" alt=\"Plugin page on the site.\"><\/a><p>Plugin page on the site.<\/p><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/userway-accessibility-widget\/assets\/screenshot-3.jpg?rev=2796965\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/userway-accessibility-widget\/assets\/screenshot-3.jpg?rev=2796965\" alt=\"\"><\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/userway-accessibility-widget\/assets\/screenshot-4.jpg?rev=2796965\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/userway-accessibility-widget\/assets\/screenshot-4.jpg?rev=2796965\" alt=\"\"><\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/userway-accessibility-widget\/assets\/screenshot-5.jpg?rev=2796965\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/userway-accessibility-widget\/assets\/screenshot-5.jpg?rev=2796965\" alt=\"\"><\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/userway-accessibility-widget\/assets\/screenshot-6.jpg?rev=2796965\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/userway-accessibility-widget\/assets\/screenshot-6.jpg?rev=2796965\" alt=\"\"><\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/userway-accessibility-widget\/assets\/screenshot-7.jpg?rev=2796965\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/userway-accessibility-widget\/assets\/screenshot-7.jpg?rev=2796965\" alt=\"\"><\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/userway-accessibility-widget\/assets\/screenshot-8.jpg?rev=2800457\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/userway-accessibility-widget\/assets\/screenshot-8.jpg?rev=2800457\" alt=\"\"><\/a><\/li><\/ol>","reviews":"<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Shortcut (Ctrl+U) conflicts with FireFox page source<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"3 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"3\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/mdimranhossain\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/52e7db23ec22ccd75b545191bd5135aa3963d5d08a014d1b18d148e8af964395?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/52e7db23ec22ccd75b545191bd5135aa3963d5d08a014d1b18d148e8af964395?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/mdimranhossain\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">mdimranhossain<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">May 6, 2026<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I do not use the functionalities provided by this plugins but Shortcut (Ctrl+U) conflicts with Mozilla FireFox page source. This hampers my daily works. I don't how many other people noticed this but developer should consider to change the shortcut.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Does the Job, But Comes With Unwanted Baggage<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"1 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"1\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/dsinozic\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/28ffdd4846fde2ad3010141363f1d859a80de483347ac5959217dcb67914a28f?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/28ffdd4846fde2ad3010141363f1d859a80de483347ac5959217dcb67914a28f?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/dsinozic\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Dario Sinozic <small>(dsinozic)<\/small><\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">July 13, 2025<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The UserWay plugin does what it's supposed to do \u2013 it improves accessibility on your website. For basic use cases and users looking for a quick solution without technical hassle, it works just fine.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>However<\/strong> \u2013 and it\u2019s a big however \u2013 the plugin persistently displays a large banner in the WordPress admin area, with no option to permanently dismiss it. There\u2019s no \u201cdon\u2019t show again\u201d button, which in 2025 feels like a UX crime. If I\u2019m already using your tool, you don\u2019t need to constantly remind me it exists. I know. I installed it.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you're looking for a cleaner experience without in-your-face admin ads and unnecessary distractions, you might want to consider alternative plugins or handle accessibility manually.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\u2714\ufe0f Performs its basic function well<br>\u274c No way to remove the admin banner<br>\u274c Pushy self-promotion inside the dashboard<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Nope. Not giving you all my personal data<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"1 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"1\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/bullrunner\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/3ce8fdc54c201bad6f9f49cd7c6347ca664365ae90be90d30066e3b89b2ba782?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/3ce8fdc54c201bad6f9f49cd7c6347ca664365ae90be90d30066e3b89b2ba782?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/bullrunner\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Bullrunner<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">June 13, 2025<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The plugin might be wonderful but, given that you *have* to subscribe and give them all your personal data in order to even test the plugin, it's a hard pass from me.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">THE BEST ADA 2025<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/raijinspirit\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/18a2934f747528db41c5e85511ffb2b9b04106662bb9349fc4f6bc7e49a6b966?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/18a2934f747528db41c5e85511ffb2b9b04106662bb9349fc4f6bc7e49a6b966?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/raijinspirit\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">raijinspirit<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">January 17, 2025<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Awesome plugin functionality <br>Professional and quick support <br>100% recommended to buy a pro plan<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Great system<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/wadegoei1975\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/78c37d593d32e7b1bd735a0e67f59eb196b4edcfa0f235f6213e4d863928a62a?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/78c37d593d32e7b1bd735a0e67f59eb196b4edcfa0f235f6213e4d863928a62a?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/wadegoei1975\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">wadegoei1975<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">January 8, 2025<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Userway works super! Great product!<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Great experience with UserWay<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/madrilenawebtmh\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/74377c6d2411826c2308ca3443187d1958f7b2e03614d516fcd2390c2f7f84cb?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/74377c6d2411826c2308ca3443187d1958f7b2e03614d516fcd2390c2f7f84cb?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/madrilenawebtmh\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">madrilenawebtmh<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">December 12, 2024<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We were looking for an accessibility solution for our corporate website, with a good look&amp;feel for smartphones and all kind of devices, easy to install and use, and reasonable price, to improve the web user experience. UserWay has overexceeded our expectations, the installation and configutaion has been really simple and the support team completely disposed, answering inmediately any question. Very happy with the decision. <\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">I installed it for my website<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/afshahin\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/fd39d698cb793be3482e17035521c7227c3ba5a406a8ec498207d3902a722cb3?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/fd39d698cb793be3482e17035521c7227c3ba5a406a8ec498207d3902a722cb3?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/afshahin\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">afshahin<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">December 5, 2024<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I installed it on my website and had some problem with stretch\u00a0my website. I contacted support, first of all, reaching them was too fast and easy. they listened to issue and resolve it very fast (actually it was my fault!). I'm going to buy this plugin and recommend it to all who want to make their website easy for all specially for whom which is working with disable people or elderlies.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Great Plugin!<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/webziss\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/f53639c6a37a50bd79823f6890b040656fd7b047c61e22406c4a0402a2513a17?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/f53639c6a37a50bd79823f6890b040656fd7b047c61e22406c4a0402a2513a17?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/webziss\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">webziss<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">November 22, 2024<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The accessibility plugin is working great, there is an option to manage the settings from the userway dashboard, change the colors and the size of the widget and more.<br>There is an area on the dashboard where ALT texts can be added for the images, and the plugin knows how to solve almost all of the accessibility issues.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Best ADA plugin!!!<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/bemacreative\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/ec7036a1b0d0321f2fd57262462504714c3610b67bceaaaf4bc5731560464305?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/ec7036a1b0d0321f2fd57262462504714c3610b67bceaaaf4bc5731560464305?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/bemacreative\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">bemacreative<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">October 19, 2024<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Userway is the only ADA plugin we use for our agencies clients. It is simple to use and even easier to setup. Customer support is always quick and easy. We love Userway!<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Best ADA plugin!!!<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\